## Project: Solve this coding problem

### [coding problem description](./coding-problem)

### [Workflow steps](for c++)

1. Write Code
   ↓
2. Save File
   ↓
3. Linter Runs (cpplint)
```
python -m cpplint --filter=-legal/copyright .\main.cpp
```
   ↓ (finds issues)
4. Fix Issues (clang-format)
```
& "$env:APPDATA\Python\Python314\Scripts\clang-format.exe" -i -style=Google .\main.cpp
```
   ↓
5. Stage for Commit (git add)
   ↓
6. Pre-commit Hooks Run (cpp_linter_hooks)
```
python -m pre_commit run --files .\main.cpp
```
   ↓ (finds issues)
7. Fix Issues
   ↓
8. Commit (with conventional message)
   ↓
9. Code Review
   ↓ (finds issues)
10. Fix Issues
   ↓
11. Merge